# Frosted Glass over Irregular Cream Artwork

Status: DONE
Milestone: M51 Replace rejected text-shaped masks with a continuous glass foreground
Dependencies: 53_CREAM_LAUNCH_BACKGROUNDS.todo, 55_CENTERED_CAKE_LABELS.todo

## Purpose

The owner rejects the old masked-cream posts. All foreground content must sit
on lightly frosted glass, with unique irregular cream structures behind it:
clusters, smaller droplets and Gaussian variation, never repeated orientations.

