- [x] Preserve the rejected edition and unchanged live website/local4174.
- [x] Generate12distinct seeded-Gaussian layouts with4irregular multi-lobe clusters and5droplets each.
- [x] Put all foreground on one continuous8%-tint glass panel; remove text-shaped masks from this mode.
- [x] Use deep-green copy on the existing cream palette so transparency does not require cutouts.
- [x] Complete regression, uniqueness, glass-transmission and actual JPEG readability checks.
