- [x] Publish image-only output and update docs/context.

## Acceptance criteria

- All foreground inside one glass panel; no per-word/line opaque patches.
- Only8%tint,92%background transmission,9pxfrost; cream remains visibly behind glass.
- Twelve distinct orientations/geometry hashes and non-repeating rendered masks.
- Four genuinely protruding, connected cream clusters plus five smaller droplets per image.
- Preserve current genuine website captures, type sizes and portrait phone-only01/06rule.
- No website/study integration, image-tool views or Instagram posting.

